    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰγο-πώγων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a goat's beard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
